What is printed?
```
int x = 12, y = 4;
char op = '-';
switch (op) {
    case '+': printf("%d", x + y); break;
    case '-': printf("%d", x - y); break;
    case '*': printf("%d", x * y); break;
    default: printf("error");
}
```

What is printed?
```
int i = 1, s = 0;
while (i < 10 && s < 15) {
    s += i;
    i++;
}
printf("%d %d", i, s);
```
